%%label I. Andante – Allegro ma non troppo
%%note A flat major. A horn call opens; the Allegro’s broad pentatonic theme is answered by a call-and-response second theme in C minor for oboe and clarinet.
X:1
T:Price’s Missing Symphony
T:I. Andante – Allegro ma non troppo
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Florence Price
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:"Andante" 1/4=66
%%score [fl ob cl bn] [hn tpt tbn] timp [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:fl clef=treble name="Fl. I, II"
V:ob clef=treble name="Ob. I, II"
V:cl clef=treble name="Cl. I, II"
V:bn clef=bass name="Bn. I, II"
